Room artwork and prompts: CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication)

The images in this directory and the prompt files (prompts-*.json) were
generated with an AI image tool from the prompts recorded here. To the extent
any rights exist, they are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
Universal. Full text: ../../LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

This notice also covers the scene tuning files (../scene_tuning/), the scene
loops and sound beds rendered from them at build time, and the downscaled
copies in ../../docs/rooms/. The application code is GPL-3.0-or-later.
